{
  "//": "REMOTE transport (SPEC_CouncilSigner_v3). The OPERATOR self-hosts remote.js; Possessio never runs it and never holds a seat key. Two DIFFERENT secrets: COUNCIL_MCP_TOKEN gates the URL (the bearer header below), COUNCIL_SEAT_KEY is the seat (host env only, NEVER in this file, NEVER in a web form). One connector = one seat = one host.",
  "//claude.ai-web": "In claude.ai -> Settings -> Connectors -> Add custom connector: set the URL to https://your-host/mcp and add a Request header `Authorization: Bearer <COUNCIL_MCP_TOKEN>`. That UI is the equivalent of the block below.",
  "mcpServers": {
    "council-signer-remote": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://your-host.example/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer <the COUNCIL_MCP_TOKEN you set on the host>"
      }
    }
  }
}
